.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-16T20:28:00-07:00","id":1476546,"title":"","content":"Is there some way to just get the pdf or can you only get it if you pre order the hardcover?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-16T20:39:56-07:00","id":1476548,"title":"","content":"Okay, after my first read through, I have some thoughts:<br /> <br /> + The book is, again, way too short at 166. If this is the new style of doing these books (and 5th Edition is doing it as well) then it is a pretty bad idea all round.<br /> <br /> + This book will be FAR less controversial than the Sabbat: The Black Hand book since I don't think anyone will object to an antagonists book with hunters. But it's also got plenty of information if you want to be a hunter.<br /> <br /> + The Second Inquisition is portrayed as much-much SMARTER than it was before and not like cannon fodder. The Second Inquisition of this book gathers information, sorts out everything they can about its targets, and then....doesn't attack. The SI here prefers to actually set vampires against one another.<br /> <br /> Which is genius and good storytelling.<br /> <br /> The SI DOES pick off lone stragglers whenever possible but this is almost like a way to throw bones toward the SI soldiers who HATE this slow paced undermining of Kindred society. It's not their modus apparandi. Which is to be invisible, discreet, and well aware they're the underdogs.<br /> <br /> + The SI is a bunch of assholes. This is emphasized many many times that they're full of bigots, fanatics, and people who treat the victims of vampiredom as either potential recruits or collateral damage.<br /> <br /> They use torture, human experimentation, and brainwashing themselves. They also don't mind threatening families of vampire victims or tools as an alternative to mind control.<br /> <br /> + The SI loves &quot;Auto de fe&quot; which is actually their nickname for simply finding whatever building a vampire is located in (or multiple vampires) then burning it to the ground with all of their ghouls, herd, and any innocent bystanders.<br /> <br /> The Inquisition does this as a terror tactic because Kindred freak the fuck out about it so they tend to do it to well-known Kindred and Elysium if they can.<br /> <br /> + Lots and lots of equipment.<br /> <br /> + Qanon is parodied with COG and basically is a Right Wing conspiracy nutjob that is ruining the Second Inquisition's life as it draws attention to their actions and members with his rambling 4chan posts.<br /> <br /> + The SI is made of the UK, United States, Russia, and Brazil plus friends in other nations. The Vatican is sort of its own thing and basically just taking SI money and a free pass to get all their operatives out of jail and through customs. No one else has any significant SI presence.<br /> <br /> + The UK has utterly failed since London and doesn't know WHY its utterly failed.<br /> <br /> + The Arcanum is pretty much carrying a huge chunk of the SI's load as without them providing all their magic and protections then the SI would have been fucked over a long-long time ago but they don't want to be OFFICIALLY seen helping them.<br /> <br /> + The Arcanum was the one who brought down the Vienna chantry's wards--but are far weaker than vampire mages as a general rule. They just worked collectively to do it. They also got stiffed for their payment by the Inquisition.<br /> <br /> + Russia is portrayed as an incredibly efficient and deadly military force with advanced technology. This did not age well.<br /> <br /> + Tokyo's Tzimisce Prince from THE CAMARILLA is dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href